WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: A quick look round - then the radio.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.900
Faisal: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22 … north concourse, Kiosk 4. Lost child.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Faisal: Boy, about 7, white thobe, short black hair. Last seen two minutes ago. I'm with the mother. Over.

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.200
Narrator: Notice he describes the boy but keeps his name off the open channel.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Narrator: His supervisor arrives and takes over.

